{"id":"624448","name":"包菜猪肉包","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624448/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"包菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"低筋面粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"10g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"230g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"包菜洗净剁碎。","img":"images/624448/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放盐泻出水，再挤一挤，备用。","img":"images/624448/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪肉先切片，再剁碎。","img":"images/624448/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入所有调料，搅拌。","img":"images/624448/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/624448/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入包菜碎，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/624448/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面包机容器放入500克面粉。","img":"images/624448/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克奶粉中倒入230克温水，搅拌均匀。凉凉后加入酵母和白糖。静置5分钟。","img":"images/624448/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再倒入面粉中。","img":"images/624448/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"按揉面功能揉面。","img":"images/624448/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再取出放入较大容器中盖上盖子发酵。","img":"images/624448/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"发酵好的面团。","img":"images/624448/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"搓成长条。","img":"images/624448/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切成剂子，压扁。","img":"images/624448/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"擀成包子皮，包上馅。","img":"images/624448/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"蒸锅锅底抹油，放入包子，二次发酵二十分钟。","img":"images/624448/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"大火蒸，水开后改中火，蒸十五分钟。关火虚蒸五分钟。出锅。","img":"images/624448/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}